1
00:01:36,150 --> 00:01:40,060
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,140 --> 00:01:42,990
[Episode 13: Social Hierarchy]

3
00:01:44,950 --> 00:01:45,810
Your Highness.

4
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:48,539
Please reconsider

5
00:01:50,229 --> 00:01:52,020
whether things can be changed.

6
00:01:55,070 --> 00:01:56,700
Your Highness, did you see

7
00:01:57,460 --> 00:01:59,350
the blue smoke in the sky just now?

8
00:02:00,260 --> 00:02:01,040
I saw it.

9
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:05,950
In two hours,

10
00:02:07,460 --> 00:02:10,699
the assassins who attacked Your Highness
on the treasure ship

11
00:02:10,699 --> 00:02:11,950
will arrive here.

12
00:02:12,850 --> 00:02:15,980
I'm afraid I won't be able to
protect Your Highness then.

13
00:02:16,690 --> 00:02:17,470
So...

14
00:02:22,010 --> 00:02:23,660
So you mean

15
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:27,140
I have no choice?

16
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:34,560
I need to use the toilet. Let me out!

17
00:02:35,230 --> 00:02:36,230
Let me out!

18
00:02:37,300 --> 00:02:39,100
Are you deaf, all of you?

19
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,190
Such a nuisance.

20
00:02:41,210 --> 00:02:42,450
What are you yelling for?

21
00:02:42,450 --> 00:02:43,780
Just do it in your pants.

22
00:02:44,130 --> 00:02:44,700
You...

23
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:46,660
How uncivilized!

24
00:02:47,570 --> 00:02:49,380
Aren't you afraid that the piss and shit

25
00:02:49,380 --> 00:02:51,660
will taint your master's food?

26
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:53,910
Exactly!

27
00:02:54,450 --> 00:02:55,070
Shut up!

28
00:02:59,950 --> 00:03:00,880
Little Xingren.

29
00:03:02,100 --> 00:03:03,100
Save your breath.

30
00:03:03,690 --> 00:03:05,750
Even if you really poop in your pants,

31
00:03:05,980 --> 00:03:07,380
he won't let us out.

32
00:03:11,030 --> 00:03:11,820
Animals.

33
00:03:20,410 --> 00:03:21,579
You've said so much,

34
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:23,720
but where is my guarantee?

35
00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:25,960
Your Highness.

36
00:03:26,860 --> 00:03:28,190
The boat is mine.

37
00:03:28,470 --> 00:03:30,740
The travel pass was signed
by me personally.

38
00:03:30,740 --> 00:03:34,150
And I've been
by Your Highness's side all along.

39
00:03:34,390 --> 00:03:36,250
Isn't that enough of a guarantee?

40
00:03:44,540 --> 00:03:45,540
Wang Ji.

41
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:48,140
If I remember correctly,

42
00:03:48,420 --> 00:03:49,350
last time,

43
00:03:49,820 --> 00:03:50,660
I was almost

44
00:03:51,260 --> 00:03:53,660
blown up on the treasure ship
you gifted me.

45
00:03:53,850 --> 00:03:55,700
Why should I trust you now?

46
00:03:55,810 --> 00:03:57,220
Your Highness, please understand.

47
00:03:57,220 --> 00:03:59,440
I did present the treasure ship,

48
00:03:59,710 --> 00:04:00,330
but

49
00:04:00,790 --> 00:04:02,650
I was completely kept in the dark.

50
00:04:02,820 --> 00:04:06,350
I really didn't participate
in the assassination and treason.

51
00:04:07,630 --> 00:04:09,430
Then who is the person behind it?

52
00:04:10,790 --> 00:04:11,580
Zhu Bukha.

53
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,370
And who is behind Zhu Bukha?

54
00:04:17,260 --> 00:04:18,140
Silent again.

55
00:04:19,810 --> 00:04:21,160
Why don't you tell me

56
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:24,890
who set off the smokes

57
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,460
in the sky?

58
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:28,070
And two hours later,

59
00:04:28,450 --> 00:04:30,050
who will be here

60
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:31,310
to take my life?

61
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:40,820
Wang Ji, you are not being honest.

62
00:04:41,050 --> 00:04:42,510
You want to work with me,

63
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,370
but you refuse to tell the truth.

64
00:04:44,370 --> 00:04:45,950
Then I can assume

65
00:04:46,450 --> 00:04:48,900
that this is all a coup
orchestrated by you.

66
00:04:49,170 --> 00:04:50,990
No, no, no. Your Highness.

67
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,380
This is really not an act.

68
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:03,260
I can write the letter.

69
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:05,140
I can also grant the title.

70
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:07,840
But once I put it in writing
and set it in stone,

71
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:09,380
I cannot go back on my word.

72
00:05:09,890 --> 00:05:11,020
So tell me,

73
00:05:11,340 --> 00:05:12,460
who is the person

74
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:13,780
behind this?

75
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:15,270
Wang Ji,

76
00:05:16,230 --> 00:05:17,630
where is your sincerity?

77
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,850
It was someone named...

78
00:05:23,190 --> 00:05:24,020
It was a lord

79
00:05:25,130 --> 00:05:27,950
surnamed Zhan who set off the smokes.

80
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:28,990
A lord?

81
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:29,720
Yes.

82
00:05:29,950 --> 00:05:31,140
Who does he take orders from?

83
00:05:31,140 --> 00:05:32,470
And who is his superior?

84
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:37,170
Your Highness,
have you ever heard of someone

85
00:05:37,550 --> 00:05:39,150
called Young Master Suanni?

86
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:52,550
The dragon has nine sons.

87
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:55,159
The fifth son is named Suanni.

88
00:05:57,140 --> 00:05:59,200
The fact that he dares to use this name

89
00:06:00,310 --> 00:06:02,080
shows his intention to rebel.

90
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:06,650
If his father wants to be a real dragon,

91
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,810
what does he take the current emperor for?

92
00:06:11,110 --> 00:06:12,400
If this isn't treason, what is?

93
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:12,960
Yes.

94
00:06:14,310 --> 00:06:15,510
It is indeed treason.

95
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:21,070
Then tell me in detail,

96
00:06:21,730 --> 00:06:23,540
who is behind this?

97
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:27,020
My brothers?

98
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:31,380
My enemies?

99
00:06:32,070 --> 00:06:33,020
A vassal king,

100
00:06:34,190 --> 00:06:35,990
or a royal relative?

101
00:06:40,380 --> 00:06:42,710
You treated me to the Gold Scraps Banquet,

102
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:46,140
prepared pen and ink,

103
00:06:47,210 --> 00:06:49,610
and kidnapped my entourage to threaten me.

104
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,500
Wang Ji,

105
00:06:53,460 --> 00:06:55,260
you keep saying

106
00:06:56,340 --> 00:06:58,400
you want to escort me back to Beijing,

107
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:00,660
but you haven't said a word

108
00:07:04,220 --> 00:07:06,150
about the person trying to harm me.

109
00:07:08,450 --> 00:07:09,750
You are not sincere!

110
00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:14,680
Your Highness,

111
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:17,770
don't push me too far.

112
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:28,260
Zhu Zhanji!

113
00:07:29,170 --> 00:07:32,630
When the ruler forces the people
to rebel, they have no choice.

114
00:07:37,510 --> 00:07:39,800
How dare you call me Zhu Zhanji?

115
00:07:40,740 --> 00:07:44,080
Cutting off someone's livelihood
is like killing their parents.

116
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:46,320
Do you know how many people

117
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:47,920
along the Grand Canal

118
00:07:48,030 --> 00:07:50,070
want you and your father dead?

119
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:52,380
Countless, like drops of water!

120
00:07:53,900 --> 00:07:57,690
Do you know how much grain
the canal transport moves every year,

121
00:07:58,500 --> 00:08:00,400
how many grain ships need to be built,

122
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:02,450
and how many workers need to be hired?

123
00:08:02,450 --> 00:08:04,510
Do you know how many lock keepers,

124
00:08:04,750 --> 00:08:07,950
porters, and trackers
need to be hired for river affairs?

125
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:12,570
Every year, the court allocates
so much funding for dredging,

126
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:15,520
Yellow River control,
and emergency expenditures.

127
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:18,370
Every step of this process
is awash with gold and silver.

128
00:08:18,370 --> 00:08:20,250
Every commoner depends on it

129
00:08:20,380 --> 00:08:21,840
and makes a living from it.

130
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:24,230
If the capital is moved,

131
00:08:24,460 --> 00:08:27,810
the north-south waterway will be severed,
and canal transport will be abolished!

132
00:08:27,810 --> 00:08:29,750
How many people will starve then?

133
00:08:29,770 --> 00:08:30,530
Insolent!

134
00:08:32,270 --> 00:08:33,909
Canal transport wastes resources

135
00:08:33,909 --> 00:08:35,039
and costs a fortune.

136
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:37,260
The people are already overwhelmed.

137
00:08:37,850 --> 00:08:40,110
Moving the capital benefits the people.

138
00:08:40,620 --> 00:08:43,880
Father exhausted himself
to implement this great policy.

139
00:08:44,270 --> 00:08:46,030
Does a profit-seeker like you

140
00:08:46,310 --> 00:08:47,710
even deserve to chime in?

141
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:51,600
I find you to be

142
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,500
a pampered fool.

143
00:08:53,740 --> 00:08:56,790
If the flow of wealth halts,
everything will become stagnant.

144
00:08:56,790 --> 00:08:57,850
Do you understand?

145
00:08:57,980 --> 00:09:00,150
You talk about moving the capital
and abolishing canal transport

146
00:09:00,150 --> 00:09:01,410
to care for the people.

147
00:09:01,430 --> 00:09:03,090
That's easier said than done!

148
00:09:03,340 --> 00:09:05,190
You keep talking about canal transport.

149
00:09:05,190 --> 00:09:06,860
Do you even know what it is?

150
00:09:07,340 --> 00:09:08,340
Do you only know

151
00:09:08,430 --> 00:09:10,760
how to write the words "canal transport"?

152
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:12,650
Have you ever seen a canal worker?

153
00:09:12,650 --> 00:09:14,310
Have you ever seen a boat tracker?

154
00:09:14,310 --> 00:09:16,170
Those are all mouths waiting to be fed!

155
00:09:16,170 --> 00:09:17,000
Do you know that?

156
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,220
Shut your mouth!

157
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:22,820
How could the Ming Empire raise

158
00:09:22,820 --> 00:09:24,620
such a heartless beast like you?

159
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,260
Say whatever you want.

160
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:30,620
Anyway, our lives are both

161
00:09:30,620 --> 00:09:31,890
on the chopping block today.

162
00:09:31,890 --> 00:09:32,500
Wang Da.

163
00:09:33,070 --> 00:09:34,270
Take him to the study.

164
00:09:34,650 --> 00:09:35,860
As for what I want...

165
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,580
Have it your way.

166
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,100
Lord Guo!

167
00:10:11,530 --> 00:10:12,460
Why are you here?

168
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:13,310
Move.

169
00:10:14,690 --> 00:10:15,310
Move!

170
00:10:16,930 --> 00:10:17,860
To the woodshed.

171
00:10:24,060 --> 00:10:24,810
Take him to the study.

172
00:10:24,810 --> 00:10:26,210
-Keep an eye on him.
-Yes.

173
00:10:27,210 --> 00:10:27,890
Lord Guo.

174
00:10:30,610 --> 00:10:31,370
Lord Guo.

175
00:10:31,630 --> 00:10:32,400
Hurry up.

176
00:10:34,390 --> 00:10:35,190
Lord Guo.

177
00:10:35,820 --> 00:10:36,310
Wang Ji.

178
00:10:36,330 --> 00:10:36,860
Lord Guo.

179
00:10:36,910 --> 00:10:37,370
Wang Ji!

180
00:10:37,410 --> 00:10:37,840
Lord Guo!

181
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,640
Come out here.

182
00:10:38,740 --> 00:10:40,170
We have an important guest today.

183
00:10:40,170 --> 00:10:41,240
I didn't know you were coming.

184
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:41,910
Wang Ji!

185
00:10:42,190 --> 00:10:42,950
I ask for your kind understanding.

186
00:10:42,950 --> 00:10:44,880
Why did you come in person?

187
00:10:45,430 --> 00:10:46,740
What else could it be?

188
00:10:47,030 --> 00:10:48,690
Of course,
I'm here to see my good old friend,

189
00:10:48,690 --> 00:10:49,820
your good master.

190
00:10:50,150 --> 00:10:52,030
I want to know how he harmed

191
00:10:52,450 --> 00:10:53,430
my son, Zhimin.

192
00:10:54,190 --> 00:10:54,980
Lord Guo.

193
00:10:55,390 --> 00:10:56,550
Please calm down.

194
00:10:56,620 --> 00:10:57,150
Have a seat first.

195
00:10:57,150 --> 00:10:58,010
Don't touch me.

196
00:10:58,070 --> 00:10:59,150
Okay, I won't.

197
00:11:01,450 --> 00:11:03,510
My lord has been restless these days.

198
00:11:03,810 --> 00:11:05,740
Why don't I make some tea first?

199
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:09,530
Okay, have some tea and take your time.

200
00:11:11,170 --> 00:11:12,070
Miss.

201
00:11:13,580 --> 00:11:15,430
These are all from my master's collection.

202
00:11:15,430 --> 00:11:16,290
Help yourself.

203
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:19,860
It's all good tea.

204
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:21,820
Thank you.

205
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,310
Lord Guo,

206
00:11:25,930 --> 00:11:27,030
you are angry,

207
00:11:27,270 --> 00:11:28,930
and I completely understand.

208
00:11:31,030 --> 00:11:32,560
My master will be here soon.

209
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:33,820
Please don't be angry.

210
00:11:33,820 --> 00:11:35,580
It's not good for your health.

211
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:38,560
These are indeed rare treasures.

212
00:11:40,430 --> 00:11:43,030
This green porcelain set
is the most suitable.

213
00:11:43,740 --> 00:11:46,360
Do you have any thin firewood
the thickness of a finger?

214
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,670
I will brew tea for my master.

215
00:11:47,670 --> 00:11:48,310
Yes, yes.

216
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,850
I'll send someone to take you to get it.

217
00:11:50,930 --> 00:11:52,730
Please remain seated, Lord Guo.

218
00:11:54,070 --> 00:11:54,670
Please.

219
00:12:09,950 --> 00:12:10,500
Stop.

220
00:12:11,410 --> 00:12:12,670
What is she doing here?

221
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:15,170
This lady needs to brew tea
for the master.

222
00:12:15,290 --> 00:12:17,740
She needs some thin firewood,
no thicker than a finger.

223
00:12:17,740 --> 00:12:18,790
The woodshed is dirty.

224
00:12:18,790 --> 00:12:20,310
It might dirty your dress, Miss.

225
00:12:20,310 --> 00:12:21,740
Just let them fetch some for you.

226
00:12:21,740 --> 00:12:22,600
Just wait here.

227
00:12:22,860 --> 00:12:23,660
I'll go get it.

228
00:12:30,070 --> 00:12:31,100
It's Doctor Su.

229
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,920
Something happened inside!

230
00:12:36,070 --> 00:12:37,530
Let's go in and take a look!

231
00:12:40,390 --> 00:12:41,190
Trying to run?

232
00:12:42,950 --> 00:12:44,880
Stop fighting. What are you doing?

233
00:12:45,050 --> 00:12:45,910
That's enough!

234
00:12:50,310 --> 00:12:51,370
Alright, alright!

235
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:53,070
What are you guys doing?

236
00:12:54,860 --> 00:12:55,950
Miss, let's go.

237
00:13:01,550 --> 00:13:02,740
Who are those people?

238
00:13:02,740 --> 00:13:04,070
Just two petty thieves.

239
00:13:04,690 --> 00:13:05,890
That was terrifying.

240
00:13:10,980 --> 00:13:11,790
Wu Dingyuan.

241
00:13:12,430 --> 00:13:13,340
Are you hurt?

242
00:13:13,780 --> 00:13:14,380
I'm fine.

243
00:13:15,740 --> 00:13:16,320
And you?

244
00:13:17,090 --> 00:13:17,850
I'm fine too.

245
00:13:23,170 --> 00:13:24,170
Doctor Su.

246
00:13:26,490 --> 00:13:27,800
Is she here to save us?

247
00:13:28,070 --> 00:13:29,800
She wants us to save ourselves.

248
00:13:33,700 --> 00:13:35,100
As expected of Doctor Su.

249
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:38,170
She uses such a thick needle
for acupuncture?

250
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:39,990
This is a tea needle.

251
00:13:40,540 --> 00:13:42,560
If you use this for acupuncture,

252
00:13:42,970 --> 00:13:44,170
you'll kill someone.

253
00:13:45,290 --> 00:13:46,080
Come on.

254
00:14:04,420 --> 00:14:06,020
Not bad, Good-for-Nothing.

255
00:14:10,500 --> 00:14:11,900
Hurry up. It's your turn.

256
00:14:15,310 --> 00:14:16,740
I... I don't know how.

257
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,620
This lock is very simple.

258
00:14:18,780 --> 00:14:20,310
It has three layers.

259
00:14:20,740 --> 00:14:23,030
Use the tip to probe it.

260
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:47,800
Lord Guo.

261
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:51,950
I had no intention of getting involved
in presenting the treasure ship.

262
00:14:51,950 --> 00:14:53,790
It was your good son, Guo Zhimin,

263
00:14:54,070 --> 00:14:55,860
who repeatedly persuaded me

264
00:14:56,170 --> 00:14:57,430
to make my stance clear

265
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:58,910
and show goodwill to the Crown Prince.

266
00:14:58,910 --> 00:15:00,980
That's why I presented the treasure ship.

267
00:15:00,980 --> 00:15:02,430
So how could I possibly have planted

268
00:15:02,430 --> 00:15:03,530
explosives on the treasure ship?

269
00:15:03,530 --> 00:15:05,390
I was completely framed.

270
00:15:07,030 --> 00:15:09,090
I know exactly what kind of person
you are, Wang Ji.

271
00:15:09,090 --> 00:15:10,550
Without your permission,

272
00:15:10,770 --> 00:15:11,690
who in the entire city of Yangzhou

273
00:15:11,690 --> 00:15:13,430
would have dared to plant explosives
on your ship?

274
00:15:13,430 --> 00:15:14,950
You're clearly bullying my son

275
00:15:14,950 --> 00:15:16,680
because dead men tell no tales!

276
00:15:18,050 --> 00:15:19,070
Come, sit down and talk.

277
00:15:19,070 --> 00:15:19,860
I won't sit!

278
00:15:22,580 --> 00:15:23,220
Fine.

279
00:15:23,930 --> 00:15:25,740
Let me put it this way, Lord Guo.

280
00:15:26,630 --> 00:15:28,980
Blowing up the treasure ship
was such a huge undertaking

281
00:15:28,980 --> 00:15:31,910
that a mere censor like him
could never have orchestrated it.

282
00:15:31,910 --> 00:15:34,000
If someone really wanted to silence him,

283
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:36,260
they wouldn't have waited for me to do it.

284
00:15:36,460 --> 00:15:37,200
Enough.

285
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:41,190
Stop putting on an act in front of me.

286
00:15:43,670 --> 00:15:44,470
Let me ask you.

287
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:46,920
Who was the person that just walked out?

288
00:15:47,210 --> 00:15:49,010
Was he the current Crown Prince?

289
00:15:52,350 --> 00:15:53,140
Lord Guo.

290
00:15:55,040 --> 00:15:57,080
Knowing too much

291
00:15:58,030 --> 00:15:59,340
is not a good thing.

292
00:15:59,550 --> 00:16:00,170
What?

293
00:16:01,390 --> 00:16:02,360
Don't tell me

294
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:04,620
you want to kill me too?

295
00:16:07,220 --> 00:16:08,820
Why would I kill you?

296
00:16:11,930 --> 00:16:14,070
Don't you want to find
the person behind this?

297
00:16:14,070 --> 00:16:16,620
His men should be here soon.

298
00:16:18,860 --> 00:16:20,070
But I'm warning you.

299
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:24,190
Since they dared to blow up
the Crown Prince's treasure ship,

300
00:16:24,190 --> 00:16:25,820
there is no telling what

301
00:16:26,550 --> 00:16:28,100
they might do once they're here.

302
00:16:28,100 --> 00:16:29,430
Are you threatening me?

303
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:31,620
I know you're no saint, Wang Ji.

304
00:16:31,790 --> 00:16:33,980
I made arrangements before coming here.

305
00:16:33,980 --> 00:16:35,310
If I don't return today,

306
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:36,210
someone will

307
00:16:36,270 --> 00:16:37,910
report your involvement in the plot
against the Crown Prince

308
00:16:37,910 --> 00:16:38,720
to the Emperor's Brother-in-Law.

309
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:39,530
By then,

310
00:16:40,100 --> 00:16:41,220
any of your schemes

311
00:16:42,570 --> 00:16:43,660
will be in vain!

312
00:17:11,460 --> 00:17:16,119
[Imperial Edict Denouncing
the Traitorous Merchant Wang Ji]

313
00:17:25,500 --> 00:17:26,130
Mount up!

314
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:36,740
Lord Guo.

315
00:17:38,030 --> 00:17:41,140
Did you see the red smoke just now?

316
00:17:42,060 --> 00:17:43,830
What tricks are you playing now?

317
00:17:43,830 --> 00:17:44,780
To be honest,

318
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:47,720
this is the reply I mentioned

319
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,500
from the person behind this.

320
00:17:50,740 --> 00:17:51,630
Red.

321
00:17:52,100 --> 00:17:54,860
Red means "leave no one alive."

322
00:17:56,780 --> 00:17:57,840
You guessed right.

323
00:17:57,960 --> 00:18:00,460
The Crown Prince
is indeed here in my residence.

324
00:18:00,460 --> 00:18:03,860
I'm preparing to escort the Crown Prince
back to the capital.

325
00:18:06,070 --> 00:18:08,200
Why should the Crown Prince trust you?

326
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:11,660
If they can kill Guo Zhimin today,

327
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:15,020
they can get rid of me, Wang Ji, tomorrow.

328
00:18:15,780 --> 00:18:18,780
Right now, the Crown Prince
is isolated and helpless.

329
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:19,980
I want to take a gamble

330
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:21,820
to atone for my crimes.

331
00:18:21,950 --> 00:18:23,220
Maybe it can buy

332
00:18:23,310 --> 00:18:26,110
a sliver of a chance
for the Wang family to survive.

333
00:18:33,500 --> 00:18:35,760
You certainly know
how to bend with the wind.

334
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:36,490
Well, people

335
00:18:37,390 --> 00:18:39,390
must learn to assess the situation.

336
00:18:41,280 --> 00:18:42,850
I have already prepared a boat.

337
00:18:42,850 --> 00:18:44,390
As long as the Crown Prince nods,

338
00:18:44,390 --> 00:18:45,920
we can set off immediately.

339
00:19:03,370 --> 00:19:04,260
Lord Guo,

340
00:19:04,850 --> 00:19:06,630
if you trust me one more time,

341
00:19:08,060 --> 00:19:09,920
hurry to the dock in the backyard.

342
00:19:10,240 --> 00:19:12,040
You can leave safely from there.

343
00:20:00,300 --> 00:20:01,500
Can you do it or not?

344
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:04,590
Don't rush me.
The more I'm rushed, the harder this is.

345
00:20:04,590 --> 00:20:05,850
Okay, I won't rush you.

346
00:20:07,870 --> 00:20:08,700
Listen.

347
00:20:09,260 --> 00:20:10,150
A little lower.

348
00:20:10,890 --> 00:20:11,590
Lower.

349
00:20:13,590 --> 00:20:14,250
Keep going.

350
00:20:14,260 --> 00:20:15,110
Don't stop.

351
00:20:15,350 --> 00:20:16,060
Push.

352
00:20:21,390 --> 00:20:23,040
As expected of
the Junior Messenger Director.

353
00:20:23,040 --> 00:20:24,170
You're really good.

354
00:20:36,540 --> 00:20:38,270
I'm here to deliver their food.

355
00:20:39,650 --> 00:20:40,650
Bring the food in.

356
00:20:43,060 --> 00:20:43,920
Where are they?

357
00:20:48,810 --> 00:20:50,770
[Wang Residence]

358
00:21:24,630 --> 00:21:26,230
Why are there so many bodies?

359
00:21:28,600 --> 00:21:30,400
Looks like there are intruders.

360
00:21:34,040 --> 00:21:34,640
Hold this.

361
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:35,330
Let's go.

362
00:22:24,670 --> 00:22:25,270
Watch out!

363
00:22:34,540 --> 00:22:35,400
Your Highness.

364
00:22:35,410 --> 00:22:36,600
-I’m fine.
-Are you hurt?

365
00:22:36,600 --> 00:22:38,530
I'm fine. Go keep watch over there.

366
00:22:39,800 --> 00:22:40,730
Little Xingren.

367
00:22:41,790 --> 00:22:42,450
Keep watch.

368
00:22:45,110 --> 00:22:45,720
I'll do it.

369
00:22:47,760 --> 00:22:48,780
I don't know where

370
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:50,840
all these enemies came from.

371
00:22:52,190 --> 00:22:54,720
A rebel calling himself
Young Master Suanni.

372
00:22:57,540 --> 00:22:59,200
Who gave you this travel pass?

373
00:23:00,280 --> 00:23:02,190
That old dog, Wang Ji.

374
00:23:02,980 --> 00:23:04,110
He changed his mind?

375
00:23:04,890 --> 00:23:07,390
Is that old fox really that kind?

376
00:23:08,780 --> 00:23:10,110
He negotiated with me.

377
00:23:10,540 --> 00:23:12,390
He wanted to exchange it
for the title of a vassal king.

378
00:23:12,390 --> 00:23:13,220
How insolent.

379
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:15,060
He has no outstanding
military achievements.

380
00:23:15,060 --> 00:23:16,990
Why should he be made a vassal king?

381
00:23:17,110 --> 00:23:18,370
He doesn't deserve it.

382
00:23:18,500 --> 00:23:19,500
I say, Old Mule.

383
00:23:19,780 --> 00:23:21,260
Are you thick-headed?

384
00:23:21,800 --> 00:23:23,060
How does the saying go?

385
00:23:23,500 --> 00:23:26,220
Where there is life, there is hope.

386
00:23:26,330 --> 00:23:27,860
Don't you understand that?

387
00:23:29,910 --> 00:23:31,460
There is no precedent
for a merchant in the Ming Empire

388
00:23:31,460 --> 00:23:32,980
to be made a vassal king.

389
00:23:33,480 --> 00:23:35,300
He wants to use this to threaten me?

390
00:23:35,300 --> 00:23:36,670
What a pipe dream.

391
00:23:37,130 --> 00:23:37,860
Are you done?

392
00:23:42,670 --> 00:23:44,200
Have you ever thought about

393
00:23:44,330 --> 00:23:46,150
what they might say about you

394
00:23:46,610 --> 00:23:47,500
if you were to

395
00:23:48,110 --> 00:23:49,060
die here today?

396
00:23:50,300 --> 00:23:51,190
Maybe

397
00:23:51,670 --> 00:23:53,960
they'd say you absconded
to avoid punishment

398
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:57,160
and died after indulging yourself
in a merchant's house.

399
00:23:58,150 --> 00:24:00,350
You can't expect a dog to spit out ivory.

400
00:24:06,350 --> 00:24:07,350
How is it outside?

401
00:24:07,740 --> 00:24:08,800
The coast is clear.

402
00:24:10,980 --> 00:24:12,580
You might as well agree to it.

403
00:24:13,130 --> 00:24:15,330
As for whether to make him a vassal king,

404
00:24:15,890 --> 00:24:17,350
wait until you return to Beijing

405
00:24:17,350 --> 00:24:18,680
to decide for yourself.

406
00:24:22,500 --> 00:24:23,460
You're right.

407
00:24:23,980 --> 00:24:25,640
Let's go with the flow for now.

408
00:24:26,150 --> 00:24:26,690
Let's go.

409
00:24:27,060 --> 00:24:27,740
Where to?

410
00:24:28,190 --> 00:24:29,050
To find Wang Ji.

411
00:24:42,430 --> 00:24:44,150
Mr. Guo, here is the antidote.

412
00:24:44,370 --> 00:24:45,300
Take it quickly.

413
00:25:19,850 --> 00:25:20,510
It's empty!

414
00:25:20,910 --> 00:25:21,910
It's empty! Move!

415
00:25:38,240 --> 00:25:39,370
Where is Zhu Zhanji?

416
00:25:42,260 --> 00:25:43,060
I don't know.

417
00:25:43,300 --> 00:25:44,160
You don't know?

418
00:25:44,300 --> 00:25:45,430
I really don't know.

419
00:25:47,740 --> 00:25:48,500
Useless.

420
00:26:00,650 --> 00:26:02,380
Wang Ji mentioned earlier that

421
00:26:02,410 --> 00:26:04,110
we can escape through the backyard dock.

422
00:26:04,110 --> 00:26:05,310
That old thief Wang Ji

423
00:26:05,500 --> 00:26:07,350
had already left a way out for himself.

424
00:26:07,350 --> 00:26:08,880
Let's use his way out, then.

425
00:26:09,600 --> 00:26:10,490
No time to lose.

426
00:26:11,740 --> 00:26:12,740
Let's go quickly.

427
00:26:13,830 --> 00:26:14,380
Let's go.

428
00:26:24,280 --> 00:26:24,950
Careful.

429
00:26:25,100 --> 00:26:25,770
Careful.

430
00:26:30,440 --> 00:26:31,290
Coast's clear.

431
00:26:31,290 --> 00:26:31,850
Let's go.

432
00:26:48,910 --> 00:26:50,560
Mr. Guo, Mr. Guo!

433
00:26:51,130 --> 00:26:51,930
What's wrong?

434
00:26:53,970 --> 00:26:54,520
Let's go.

435
00:26:54,830 --> 00:26:55,390
Let's go.

436
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:56,590
Let's go.

437
00:26:58,870 --> 00:27:00,670
Where is the antidote I gave you?

438
00:27:01,350 --> 00:27:03,150
Where is the antidote I gave you?

439
00:27:03,860 --> 00:27:04,730
Miss Su.

440
00:27:06,350 --> 00:27:08,610
The Guo family has committed grave sins.

441
00:27:09,780 --> 00:27:10,670
If I die,

442
00:27:12,500 --> 00:27:13,500
it's for the best.

443
00:27:20,850 --> 00:27:22,710
Your Highness, the Crown Prince.

444
00:27:30,530 --> 00:27:31,440
My son

445
00:27:32,930 --> 00:27:34,460
was disloyal and unfilial.

446
00:27:36,950 --> 00:27:37,780
I will atone

447
00:27:39,880 --> 00:27:41,050
on his behalf.

448
00:27:59,630 --> 00:28:01,760
I will no longer pursue the Guo family.

449
00:28:17,610 --> 00:28:18,540
Hurry up and go.

450
00:28:18,930 --> 00:28:19,430
Hurry.

451
00:28:23,350 --> 00:28:24,020
Let's go.

452
00:28:25,670 --> 00:28:26,220
Let's go.

453
00:28:45,110 --> 00:28:45,540
Let's go.

454
00:28:45,540 --> 00:28:46,150
This way.

455
00:28:47,060 --> 00:28:47,990
Watch your step.

456
00:28:49,460 --> 00:28:50,390
Come, Doctor Su.

457
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:51,430
Hurry.

458
00:28:51,540 --> 00:28:52,150
No.

459
00:28:52,740 --> 00:28:53,540
I can't leave.

460
00:28:54,110 --> 00:28:56,060
I can't just leave him here like this.

461
00:28:56,060 --> 00:28:57,260
Mr. Guo entrusted me

462
00:28:57,780 --> 00:29:00,040
to bury him with Guo Zhimin after he dies.

463
00:29:01,150 --> 00:29:01,880
You go first.

464
00:29:02,080 --> 00:29:03,610
I'll find a way to reach you.

465
00:29:04,890 --> 00:29:05,440
Okay.

466
00:29:05,940 --> 00:29:06,620
Take care.

467
00:29:08,390 --> 00:29:10,590
You must be careful
of that Young Master Suanni.

468
00:29:10,590 --> 00:29:11,160
Got it?

469
00:29:11,630 --> 00:29:12,200
Okay.

470
00:29:12,600 --> 00:29:13,460
Hurry off, now.

471
00:29:46,690 --> 00:29:47,300
Search!

472
00:29:47,490 --> 00:29:48,400
Yes.

473
00:30:00,040 --> 00:30:00,700
Master.

474
00:30:02,770 --> 00:30:05,170
Do you think the Crown Prince
and the others

475
00:30:05,200 --> 00:30:06,400
can leave Yangzhou?

476
00:30:08,890 --> 00:30:09,670
Probably.

477
00:30:10,830 --> 00:30:11,630
Then,

478
00:30:13,190 --> 00:30:15,120
can they really return to Beijing?

479
00:30:16,040 --> 00:30:17,020
Hard to say.

480
00:30:18,980 --> 00:30:20,910
Yangzhou is still

481
00:30:22,350 --> 00:30:23,780
too far from Beijing.

482
00:30:29,400 --> 00:30:33,270
You followed me after leaving
the Ministry of Rites.

483
00:30:35,330 --> 00:30:36,260
Do you regret it?

484
00:30:39,110 --> 00:30:40,570
You want my honest answer?

485
00:30:42,040 --> 00:30:43,040
I don't regret it.

486
00:30:44,350 --> 00:30:45,060
Really?

487
00:30:45,800 --> 00:30:46,630
That's a lie.

488
00:30:59,040 --> 00:31:01,040
Actually, I regret it too.

489
00:31:03,500 --> 00:31:05,630
If I hadn't tried to please both sides,

490
00:31:07,060 --> 00:31:09,590
would today's outcome be different?

491
00:31:15,280 --> 00:31:16,280
Not necessarily.

492
00:31:18,450 --> 00:31:20,510
What's so good about doing business?

493
00:31:20,540 --> 00:31:21,740
If you do poorly,

494
00:31:22,650 --> 00:31:24,250
you get swallowed by others.

495
00:31:24,520 --> 00:31:25,670
If you do well,

496
00:31:27,090 --> 00:31:29,540
you get framed by jealous people.

497
00:31:45,220 --> 00:31:46,280
It's meaningless.

498
00:31:50,470 --> 00:31:51,880
Truly meaningless.

499
00:32:16,150 --> 00:32:19,500
[Countdown: 11 days]

500
00:32:35,070 --> 00:32:35,930
Your Highness.

501
00:32:36,140 --> 00:32:37,200
An hour has passed.

502
00:32:37,590 --> 00:32:38,590
I feel fine.

503
00:32:39,020 --> 00:32:41,620
You can enjoy
this bowl of pork rib noodles now.

504
00:33:03,690 --> 00:33:04,260
Old Mule.

505
00:33:05,590 --> 00:33:07,630
You have to eat noodles with garlic.

506
00:33:07,980 --> 00:33:08,500
Here.

507
00:33:13,870 --> 00:33:14,930
I never eat garlic.

508
00:33:16,220 --> 00:33:17,950
Then you should really try it.

509
00:33:18,090 --> 00:33:18,700
Try it.

510
00:33:39,980 --> 00:33:40,500
Your Highness.

511
00:33:40,500 --> 00:33:42,030
I'll go get some warm water.

512
00:33:42,170 --> 00:33:42,780
No need.

513
00:33:43,890 --> 00:33:46,530
I can tolerate this taste.

514
00:33:51,140 --> 00:33:52,670
Are you trying to poison me?

515
00:34:07,590 --> 00:34:08,320
Give it to me.

516
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:09,760
No need to test it.

517
00:34:32,420 --> 00:34:33,219
Rectifier Yu.

518
00:34:35,620 --> 00:34:37,870
There's no need for this from now on.

519
00:35:06,370 --> 00:35:07,770
You spat that pretty far.

520
00:35:07,850 --> 00:35:08,750
Wanna compete?

521
00:35:09,000 --> 00:35:09,960
Bring it on.

522
00:35:29,140 --> 00:35:32,250
♪ When the world mocks absurd wishes ♪

523
00:35:32,280 --> 00:35:35,780
♪ You chose to join me in my folly ♪

524
00:35:36,300 --> 00:35:39,050
♪ When people can only share weal ♪

525
00:35:39,070 --> 00:35:42,960
♪ You only wish to share my woe ♪

526
00:35:43,080 --> 00:35:46,210
♪ A heart full of burning passion,
a passion that burns in the heart ♪

527
00:35:46,230 --> 00:35:49,350
♪ Battered and bruised all along the way ♪

528
00:35:49,370 --> 00:35:52,320
♪ Things I cannot repay you
for in this lifetime ♪

529
00:35:52,340 --> 00:35:55,630
♪ I will keep it etched in my heart ♪

530
00:36:00,950 --> 00:36:01,830
Alright.

531
00:36:04,270 --> 00:36:05,710
You threw it with your hand, right?

532
00:36:05,710 --> 00:36:06,440
No, I didn't.

533
00:37:30,870 --> 00:37:32,710
Your previous account
of dam-crossing

534
00:37:32,710 --> 00:37:34,040
was truly fascinating.

535
00:37:34,460 --> 00:37:36,260
Seeing it with my own eyes today,

536
00:37:36,740 --> 00:37:38,540
I realize how spectacular it is.

537
00:37:38,810 --> 00:37:40,010
Look, Your Highness.

538
00:37:40,540 --> 00:37:42,060
Starting from Yangzhou,

539
00:37:42,310 --> 00:37:44,640
we've been traveling on man-made canals.

540
00:37:45,380 --> 00:37:46,790
But at Mokou in Huai'an,

541
00:37:47,210 --> 00:37:50,010
there is a dam between the canal
and the Huai River.

542
00:37:50,750 --> 00:37:51,950
The water levels don't match.

543
00:37:51,950 --> 00:37:53,010
There's a big drop,

544
00:37:53,600 --> 00:37:55,260
so ships can't pass directly.

545
00:37:56,230 --> 00:37:57,560
After the Song Dynasty,

546
00:37:57,730 --> 00:37:59,790
the Yellow River took over the Huai River.

547
00:37:59,790 --> 00:38:01,450
This stretch of the Huai River

548
00:38:01,540 --> 00:38:03,830
also serves as a channel
for the Yellow River.

549
00:38:03,830 --> 00:38:05,920
The scene of grain ships
passing the dam and locks

550
00:38:05,920 --> 00:38:07,330
is so spectacular,

551
00:38:08,050 --> 00:38:10,710
but it requires a lot of manpower
and resources.

552
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:13,620
That's right, Your Highness.

553
00:38:13,660 --> 00:38:16,170
To pass the dam,
the cargo must first be unloaded

554
00:38:16,170 --> 00:38:18,020
and transported over the dam by land.

555
00:38:18,020 --> 00:38:20,430
The empty boat is then hauled over the dam
using winches and rollers

556
00:38:20,430 --> 00:38:21,630
operated by workers,

557
00:38:21,830 --> 00:38:23,330
before being lowered into the river

558
00:38:23,330 --> 00:38:25,390
on the other side with ropes.

559
00:38:25,540 --> 00:38:27,140
The cargo is then reloaded onto the boat.

560
00:38:27,140 --> 00:38:28,560
It's extremely labor-intensive.

561
00:38:28,560 --> 00:38:29,560
Look, Your Highness.

562
00:38:29,560 --> 00:38:31,040
In the temples along the way,

563
00:38:31,040 --> 00:38:32,620
the deity enshrined is none other than

564
00:38:32,620 --> 00:38:35,020
the Fourth Great King
of the Golden Dragon.

565
00:38:35,100 --> 00:38:37,160
After the Yuan army occupied Lin'an,

566
00:38:38,000 --> 00:38:39,710
a scholar named Xie Xu

567
00:38:40,180 --> 00:38:42,710
threw himself
into the water in indignation.

568
00:38:44,000 --> 00:38:45,430
Later, when Emperor Hongwu

569
00:38:45,430 --> 00:38:48,370
fought a great battle
with the Yuan army at Lüliang Rapids,

570
00:38:48,370 --> 00:38:50,350
Xie Xu suddenly manifested his spirit

571
00:38:50,350 --> 00:38:51,880
and defeated the Yuan army.

572
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:55,580
So the people titled him

573
00:38:56,480 --> 00:38:58,880
the Fourth Great King
of the Golden Dragon,

574
00:38:58,980 --> 00:39:00,180
the God of the Canal.

575
00:39:06,120 --> 00:39:07,270
Keep going.

576
00:39:08,290 --> 00:39:09,140
And then?

577
00:39:10,320 --> 00:39:11,780
I thought you fell asleep.

578
00:39:12,380 --> 00:39:14,240
Suddenly manifested his spirit?

579
00:39:14,890 --> 00:39:16,460
Sounds like nonsense.

580
00:39:17,140 --> 00:39:19,470
I'm telling you, you must show reverence.

581
00:39:20,480 --> 00:39:21,730
There's always a "just in case,"

582
00:39:21,730 --> 00:39:22,430
you know?

583
00:39:27,740 --> 00:39:28,550
You

584
00:39:29,660 --> 00:39:31,660
have just read yourself silly.

585
00:39:32,770 --> 00:39:33,970
Let me put it this way.

586
00:39:34,250 --> 00:39:35,140
In this world,

587
00:39:35,460 --> 00:39:37,590
no one worships the Buddha sincerely.

588
00:39:38,500 --> 00:39:40,850
They are all doing business
with the Buddha.

589
00:39:40,850 --> 00:39:42,230
If you grant my wish,

590
00:39:42,680 --> 00:39:44,750
I will build you a golden statue.

591
00:39:45,430 --> 00:39:47,620
If you don't grant my wish,

592
00:39:48,500 --> 00:39:49,700
I'll come to your door

593
00:39:49,850 --> 00:39:52,230
and smash your clay statue.

594
00:39:52,710 --> 00:39:53,350
Got it?

595
00:40:06,720 --> 00:40:10,460
[Iron Alliance's Liang Xingfu]

596
00:40:15,980 --> 00:40:17,500
You people on the boat,

597
00:40:17,910 --> 00:40:19,580
where are you heading?

598
00:40:20,060 --> 00:40:21,120
What's that sound?

599
00:40:22,310 --> 00:40:24,180
Isn't this what you just said,

600
00:40:24,430 --> 00:40:27,160
some immortal named Xie
manifesting his spirit?

601
00:40:30,910 --> 00:40:31,460
Who is it?

602
00:40:32,270 --> 00:40:32,750
Who?

603
00:40:37,460 --> 00:40:38,590
Good-for-Nothing!

604
00:40:44,900 --> 00:40:47,230
Isn't that Liang Xingfu, the Sick Madman?

605
00:40:49,700 --> 00:40:51,980
Didn't you two say he burned to death
in the Imperial Archives?

606
00:40:51,980 --> 00:40:52,500
He did!

607
00:40:53,520 --> 00:40:54,380
Your Highness!

608
00:40:54,830 --> 00:40:55,480
Your Highness!

609
00:40:55,480 --> 00:40:56,660
Don't resist.

610
00:40:57,290 --> 00:40:58,600
-Don’t struggle.
-Your Highness.

611
00:40:58,600 --> 00:40:59,460
Your Highness!

612
00:41:03,830 --> 00:41:05,230
Today, right here,

613
00:41:06,950 --> 00:41:08,350
let's end this.

614
00:41:09,110 --> 00:41:10,840
To hell with you, Liang Xingfu!

615
00:41:26,770 --> 00:41:27,900
Good-for-Nothing!

616
00:41:31,160 --> 00:41:32,290
Run, Your Highness!

617
00:41:51,850 --> 00:41:52,580
Sick Madman!

618
00:43:04,310 --> 00:43:05,040
Sick Madman!
